cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SEMplex: a browser-based tool for questionnaire-based structural equation modeling, sensitivity analysis, and decision logging"
abstract: "Open-source browser application for questionnaire data: screening, reliability and validity, EFA, CFA, covariance-based SEM, mediation and moderation, a comparison of seven construct representations for one structural coefficient, and a reversible decision log. All computation runs client-side in Pyodide."
type: software
version: 1.4.1
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/s-matysik/semplex"
url: "https://s-matysik.github.io/semplex/"
keywords:
  - structural equation modeling
  - confirmatory factor analysis
  - survey research
  - sensitivity analysis
  - reproducibility
  - WebAssembly
